th the implementation, and neither to find a better solution at this point.  It's not just this feature, I closed 200 issues today to try and get some future focus.  \n\nI haven't made the change in the code yet, we cannot deprecate it in time for the 4.0 release, but I can remove the feature from documentation to avoid new users finding out about it.\n\nI would like to have a solution for it, but this being open source we have no money to throw at it and no companies to help us.  Only a shit ton of issues that bring me down every day to the point of just choosing one to work on is difficult.  I have 24000 unread mails in my inbox, and all I can do is just look at them fly by.\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/celery/celery/issues/comments/228242707/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"ask","id":1558,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1NTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1558?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ask","html_url":"https://github.com/ask","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ask/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ask/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ask/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ask/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ask/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ask/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ask/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ask/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ask/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/celery/celery/issues/comments/228253349","html_url":"https://github.com/celery/celery/issues/2202#issuecomment